{"ts":"2026-06-03T02:26:12Z","session":"28ae9609-9940-433d-944d-fd83886468f4","event":"prompt","text":"Fix the outreach drafting UI buttons to have the correct full button flow with working state transitions for both roles.\nAnalyst view:\n\nInitial state: Show \"Generate Draft\" and \"Copy\" buttons side by side below the RAG sources section. Below those, show a full-width neon green \"SUBMIT FOR APPROVAL\" button\nAfter submitting: Keep \"Generate Draft\" and \"Copy\" buttons visible but dimmed and disabled. Replace the submit button with a muted full-width status bar that says \"AWAITING APPROVAL — Waiting for a manager to approve this draft.\"\n\nManager view:\n\nInitial state: Show \"Generate Draft\" and \"Copy\" buttons side by side below the RAG sources section. Below those, show a full-width muted status bar that says \"AWAITING APPROVAL — Review the draft above, then approve or reject.\" Below that, show \"Reject\" and \"Approve\" buttons side by side — Reject has a red outline with red text, Approve has a green outline with green text\nAfter clicking Approve: Replace the reject/approve buttons with a full-width green outlined status bar that says \"✓ Approved — ready to send\". Below that show a full-width neon green \"SEND OUTREACH & SYNC CRM\" button with a send icon\nAfter clicking Reject: Reset back to the initial draft state\n\nAll buttons must be functional and trigger the correct state transitions. Keep the existing RAG grounded / sources section intact above the buttons. Match the existing dark theme styling."}
